  {
   "date": "2026-08-28",
   "theatre": "Iran / Strait of Hormuz",
   "tag": "Ground Invasion Tracker",
   "headline": "GROUND INVASION TRACKER — DAY 183: STATUS HOLDS NO_GROUND_TROOPS, AND THE CYCLE'S DECISIVE FACT IS THAT THE CARRIER FORCE IS BEING ROTATED RATHER THAN MASSED. THE USS THEODORE ROOSEVELT CARRIER STRIKE GROUP WILL DEPLOY FROM SAN DIEGO TO THE MIDDLE EAST 'WITHIN WEEKS' TO RELIEVE THE USS GEORGE WASHINGTON, ON A DEPLOYMENT OF AT LEAST SEVEN MONTHS WITH CREWS TOLD TO PLAN FOR EIGHT. THE GEORGE WASHINGTON ENTERED FIFTH FLEET IN THE WEEK OF AUGUST 20 TO RELIEVE THE USS ABRAHAM LINCOLN, WHICH LEFT CENTCOM ON AUGUST 22 AFTER A DEPLOYMENT OF MORE THAN 200 DAYS. THAT IS A ONE-FOR-ONE RELIEF SEQUENCE SUSTAINING A SINGLE CARRIER IN THEATRE — DOWN FROM THE TWO CENTCOM CITED IN JULY AND THE THREE-CARRIER POSTURE OF APRIL. FORCE GENERATION SIZED FOR ENDURANCE IS NOT FORCE GENERATION SIZED FOR A LANDING, AND THE EIGHT-MONTH PLANNING HORIZON CARRIES THE POSTURE INTO 2027. THE SECOND STRUCTURAL DATAPOINT POINTS THE SAME WAY AND IS NEW IN KIND: THE JUSTICE DEPARTMENT IS REVIVING MARITIME PRIZE COURTS TO CONDEMN SEIZED IRANIAN TANKERS AND CARGO AS US PROPERTY, WITH PROCEEDS TO THE TREASURY — INSTITUTIONAL INVESTMENT IN A LONG BLOCKADE. THE WHITE HOUSE DESCRIBED THE INSTRUMENT SET IN ITS OWN WORDS ON AUGUST 27: 'CONTINUING TO PULL EVERY ECONOMIC LEVER,' WITH 'THE NAVAL BLOCKADE... PROVEN HUGELY SUCCESSFUL.' NO GROUND REFERENCE. THE COUNTER-INDICATORS ARE LOGGED WITHOUT DISCOUNT: A THIRD CARRIER STRIKE GROUP IS BEING GENERATED FOR THE THEATRE, THE BOXER ARG WITH THE 11TH MEU REMAINS IN THE ARABIAN SEA ON ITS 59TH DAY, AND A FORMER MOSSAD CHIEF SAID PUBLICLY THAT THERE IS 'NO CHOICE' BUT TO STRIKE 'UNTIL THE REGIME FALLS.' KHARG ISLAND: NOT SEIZED, NOT TARGETED, NOT MENTIONED. USS TRIPOLI: IN PORT AT SASEBO, JAPAN — OUTSIDE CENTCOM ENTIRELY. DRAFT RUNG: UNCHANGED, WITH THE AUTOMATIC-REGISTRATION DATE NOW FIXED AT DECEMBER 18, 2026. EVERY EXECUTION INDICATOR AT ZERO FOR A 183RD DAY.",
