   "date": "2026-08-25",
   "theatre": "Iran / Strait of Hormuz",
   "tag": "Iran War",
   "headline": "DAY 180 — THE FINANCIAL OFFENSIVE ARRIVED AND IT HAS A NAME: 'OPERATION ECONOMIC OUTCAST.' BESSENT HELD THE 2 P.M. ET NEWS CONFERENCE ON AUGUST 24 AND UNVEILED FIVE SECTORAL DETERMINATIONS — DIGITAL ASSETS, TECHNOLOGY, GOLD, AVIATION AND SHIPPING — WITH NEARLY 60 IRAN-LINKED PEOPLE, ENTITIES AND VESSELS DESIGNATED ACROSS THE UAE, HONG KONG, CHINA, SINGAPORE AND SWITZERLAND, AND EVERY COUNTRY GIVEN A DEFINED TIMELINE AND A 'CURE PERIOD' BEFORE SECONDARY SANCTIONS BITE. THE STATED OBJECTIVE IS NO LONGER AMBIGUOUS: 'IT IS GOING TO WORK IN IRAN, AND WE ARE GOING TO COLLAPSE THIS REGIME.' THE WHITE HOUSE POSITIONED IT AS THE 'ENDGAME' PHASE SUCCEEDING OPERATION EPIC FURY. AND THE MARKET MARKED IT DOWN: BRENT FELL ON THE DAY OF THE 'SINGLE GREATEST FINANCIAL OFFENSIVE EVER MARSHALLED,' CLOSING AROUND $92-93 AFTER TWO WEEKS OF GAINS. THE RIAL HIT A RECORD 2.02 MILLION TO THE DOLLAR. SECRETARY OF WAR HEGSETH SAID MILITARY FORCE IS NOT RULED OUT IN THE STRAIT 'OR ANYWHERE ELSE' — THE CYCLE'S ONE COUNTER-INDICATOR. TWO TANKERS WERE HIT: THE SAUDI VLCC AMZAN BY HOUTHI BALLISTIC MISSILE AND DRONES OFF YANBU, AND AN UNNAMED TANKER DISABLED IN ITS ENGINE ROOM NINE MILES OFF OMAN'S ASH SHISHAH AT 0131Z TODAY. CENTCOM REACHED 71 REDIRECTED, 3 DISABLED, 2 BOARDED — AND DISCLOSED FOR THE FIRST TIME THAT MORE THAN 40 HUMANITARIAN AID VESSELS HAVE BEEN PERMITTED THROUGH. A TWENTY-FOURTH CONSECUTIVE NIGHT PASSED WITH NO CONFIRMED US OR ISRAELI STRIKE INSIDE IRAN. PENTAGON CASUALTIES HOLD AT 775, AND THE SERVICE BREAKDOWN IS NEW AND POINTED: 19 OF 757 WOUNDED ARE MARINES. STILL AIR, NAVAL AND FINANCIAL ONLY — NO LANDING, NO KHARG SEIZURE, NO DRAFT ORDER. PREDICTED US GROUND SEIZURE REMAINS DISCONFIRMED FOR A 180TH DAY.",
