   "headline": "DAY 177 — THE WAR CHANGED CATEGORY. TRUMP CANCELLED THE THREATENED MULTI-DAY ENERGY CAMPAIGN LATE ON AUGUST 1 — 'I AM CANCELING THE ATTACK,' CITING PROGRESS TOWARD A DEAL AND REQUESTS FROM IRAN AND 'OTHER MIDDLE EASTERN COUNTRIES' — AND NO US OR ISRAELI STRIKE INSIDE IRAN WAS CONFIRMED BY CENTCOM THROUGH AUGUST 19, A TWENTIETH CONSECUTIVE NIGHT. THE 60-DAY MOU NEGOTIATING WINDOW AGREED IN JUNE EXPIRED ON AUGUST 17 WITH NO AGREEMENT: TRUMP DEMANDED IRAN 'PUT UP THE WHITE FLAG OF SURRENDER,' SAID 'I HAVE NO TIME SCHEDULE,' THREATENED TO 'BOMB THE S*** OUT OF' OMAN IF IT 'GETS IN THE WAY,' AND SAID HE LIKED 'THE IDEA OF DECLARING [THE STRAIT] A TERRITORY.' ON AUGUST 20 VICE PRESIDENT JD VANCE DECLARED A 'NEW PHASE' OF ECONOMIC PRESSURE AND TREASURY SECRETARY SCOTT BESSENT PROMISED 'THE TOUGHEST SANCTIONS IN HISTORY' AND 'THE GREATEST COORDINATED ECONOMIC ISOLATION IN THE HISTORY OF THE WORLD,' WITH DETAILS DUE MONDAY AUGUST 24; BESSENT ALSO SAID THE US LIKELY WOULD NOT RESTART LARGE-SCALE COMBAT. IRAN AND OMAN ANNOUNCED A HORMUZ ARRANGEMENT ON AUGUST 6-7 BARRING US AND ISRAELI VESSELS AND FINING VIOLATORS UP TO 20% OF CARGO VALUE; WASHINGTON REJECTED IT. THE UAE DETECTED TWO IRANIAN BALLISTIC MISSILES ON AUGUST 18 AND SUSPENDED ALL TRADE WITH IRAN ON AUGUST 19. USS ABRAHAM LINCOLN LEFT THE THEATRE AFTER 252 DAYS WITHOUT A PORT CALL; USS GEORGE WASHINGTON RELIEVED IT — A ROTATION, NOT A SURGE. BRENT ~$94; HORMUZ TRANSITS 1-13 A DAY AGAINST A 73/DAY BASELINE; PENTAGON CASUALTIES 775 (18 KILLED, 757 WOUNDED). STILL AIR, NAVAL AND NOW FINANCIAL ONLY — NO LANDING, NO KHARG SEIZURE, NO DRAFT. PREDICTED US GROUND SEIZURE REMAINS DISCONFIRMED.",
