   "date": "2026-08-22",
   "headline": "DAY 177 GROUND-INVASION TRACKER — STATUS HOLDS no_ground_troops FOR A 177TH CONSECUTIVE DAY, AND THIS IS THE CYCLE IN WHICH THE LADDER WAS PUBLICLY DISMANTLED RATHER THAN CLIMBED. (1) THE PRESIDENT CANCELLED THE THREATENED CAMPAIGN BY NAME ON AUGUST 1 AND NO US OR ISRAELI STRIKE INSIDE IRAN WAS CONFIRMED THROUGH AUGUST 19 — TWENTY CONSECUTIVE NIGHTS. (2) THE ADMINISTRATION NAMED ITS NEXT PHASE AND IT IS FINANCIAL: VANCE'S 'NEW PHASE' OF ECONOMIC PRESSURE, BESSENT'S 'GREATEST COORDINATED ECONOMIC ISOLATION IN THE HISTORY OF THE WORLD' — AND BESSENT SAID THE US LIKELY WOULD NOT RESTART LARGE-SCALE COMBAT. (3) THE CARRIER MOVE WAS A RELIEF, NOT A SURGE: LINCOLN OUT AFTER 252 DAYS WITHOUT A PORT CALL, GEORGE WASHINGTON IN; PRESENCE UNCHANGED AT ONE. (4) THE BOXER ARG WITH THE 11TH MEU REMAINS THE SOLE DEPLOYED AMPHIBIOUS READY GROUP FLEET-WIDE, WITH NO TASKING, EMBARKATION OR REHEARSAL, AND USS TRIPOLI HOME SINCE JULY 22 WITH THE 31ST MEU ASHORE. (5) KHARG WAS NOT STRUCK AND NOT TAKEN — IT WAS THROTTLED BY BLOCKADE AND INSURANCE, THE SUBSTITUTION THIS AUDIT HAS TRACKED SINCE MARCH — AND A DARK VLCC LOADED THERE ON AUGUST 12 FOR THE FIRST TIME SINCE JULY 18. (6) CENTCOM'S NEW CAPABILITY IS TASK FORCE FALCON STRIKE, MULTINATIONAL ONE-WAY ATTACK DRONES — MORE STANDOFF, NOT MORE BOOTS. (7) THE DRAFT RUNG WENT QUIET: THE SELECTIVE SERVICE 'READINESS SIMULATION' VENDOR WINDOW CLOSED AUGUST 14 WITH NO AWARD ANNOUNCED AND THE WITHDRAWN AUTO-REGISTRATION RULE STILL NOT RE-PROPOSED. EVERY EXECUTION INDICATOR REMAINS AT ZERO.",
   "theatre": "Iran / Strait of Hormuz",
