      "The Washington Times, reporting the unanswered casualty question"
     ],
     "why_unresolvable": "Base-damage claims of this kind are settled by imagery or by a casualty announcement, neither of which exists here. The asymmetry matters: CENTCOM issued a specific denial on airframes and a silence on personnel, and a silence is not a denial. This project's own casualty metric is separately unreliable while the 'Overseas Operations' reclassification remains unexplained.",
     "open_question_ref": "irgc-al-azraq-f35-casualty-claim-july-2026"
    }
