  {
   "date": "2026-07-26",
   "headline": "DAY 150 GROUND-INVASION TRACKER — STATUS HOLDS no_ground_troops, AND FOR THE FIRST TIME IN TWO WEEKS THE KINETIC INDICATOR FELL: the 13-night US air campaign STOPPED with no CENTCOM announcement, no landing, no Kharg seizure, no new ARG/MEU order and no draft; 50,000+ personnel unchanged. The July 24 Pentagon ground-ops OPTIONS reporting stands but Trump has NOT decided ('finger on trigger'), and the pause is read by ex-SecDef Esper as possible repositioning for 'something much bigger.' The only new direct-strike actors were ALLIED AIR FORCES (Bahrain/Kuwait per WSJ; Kuwait denies) — not US ground forces. Predicted US ground seizure stays disconfirmed.",
