    "WASHINGTON DOWNPLAYS DIPLOMACY (July 22, 2026): Rubio said Tehran is 'not serious' about negotiations; Trump dismissed ceasefire calls, demanding Iran first stop attacking US forces and shipping, and threatened to 'bomb and destroy ONE BRIDGE OR POWER PLANT' for every Hormuz ship attack. The Qatar/Pakistan 10-day ceasefire proposal was left unanswered as the White House signaled it could keep striking. (CNBC; CNN live blog, July 22, 2026.)",
    "OIL PAST $95, 'NO WAY OUT' (July 22, 2026): Brent rose almost 5% to more than $95/bbl — its highest in nearly six weeks — as the US downplayed talks and the Houthi Bab el-Mandeb blockade threatened Saudi Arabia's Red Sea export 'relief valve' with both key routes now compromised. Still below the ~$126 April wartime peak and the $130+ a sustained US GROUND commitment would imply. (NBC News; CNN Business, July 22, 2026.)",
