  {
   "date": "2026-07-22",
   "headline": "DAY 146 — THREE NEW FRONTS OPEN WITHOUT A GROUND LANDING: (1) TRUMP THREATENS TO STRIKE IRAN'S 'PICKAXE MOUNTAIN' UNDERGROUND NUCLEAR-ENRICHMENT SITE 'PROBABLY PRETTY SOON... THERE'S NOT A THING THEY CAN DO ABOUT IT'; (2) IRAN-ALIGNED HOUTHIS DECLARE A BLOCKADE OF THE BAB EL-MANDEB, A SECOND CHOKEPOINT — TWO SAUDI CRUDE TANKERS U-TURN FROM YANBU; (3) QATAR AND PAKISTAN (WITH EGYPT/OMAN) FLOAT A 10-DAY US-IRAN CEASEFIRE AND A HORMUZ 'MIDDLE CORRIDOR,' WHICH IRAN CONFIRMS RECEIVING. THE 10TH STRAIGHT NIGHT OF US STRIKES (SIRIK, BANDAR ABBAS, QESHM, SHIRAZ, ISFAHAN) IS DONE AND AN 11TH IS ANTICIPATED; BRENT ~$91. STILL AIR/MARITIME/NUCLEAR-THREAT COERCION — NOT A GROUND SEIZURE; GROUND RUNG UNCHANGED (~50,000 PERSONNEL).",
