   "prediction_impact": "The corpus-predicted US GROUND seizure of Hormuz/Kharg remains disconfirmed. Day 143 deepened the AIR/MARITIME campaign — a widening into central Iran, the first use of manned fighter jets, a surge of refueling tankers to Israel to enable a broader air effort, and a second strike on a tanker at Kharg — but added NO US ground forces: no landing, no port/island seizure, no new ARG/MEU order, no draft. The US is escalating how it strikes and coerces, not putting troops ashore (CONTESTED-UNRESOLVED — open-question: kharg-seizure-total-control-threat-june-2026).",
