   "prediction_impact": "The corpus-predicted US GROUND seizure of Hormuz/Kharg remains disconfirmed. Day 141's developments — a sixth day of strikes, an expansion into northern Iran, and the blockade's first interdiction of a KHARG-BOUND vessel — are escalations of the AIR and MARITIME campaign that tighten the economic noose on Kharg without a landing. The mechanism of the deepening US move toward chokepoint control is blockade + air strikes + maritime interdiction, not a troop landing.",
