    "US-CHINA (July 6-13, 2026): The China-Russia 'Joint Sea-2026' naval exercise (July 6-13, waters/airspace near Qingdao) concluded, following a July 6 PLA submarine-launched ballistic-missile test in the South Pacific demonstrating second-strike reach; Taiwan commissioned a new Littoral Combat Command July 1. The Trump-Xi one-year tariff truce (agreed in South Korea in October) held. (AEI, 'China & Taiwan Update, July 10, 2026'; NBC News.)",
