    "FORCE POSTURE UNCHANGED (July 10-11, 2026): ~50,000 US personnel in the CENTCOM AOR and ~24 warships (carriers Abraham Lincoln and George H.W. Bush, 15 destroyers) per Stars and Stripes (July 1); the USS Boxer ARG / 11th MEU and USS Tripoli ARG / 31st MEU remained in the Arabian Sea in routine/contingency posture. No new July deployment, ARG/MEU landing order, or forcible-entry staging was reported. (Stars and Stripes, July 1; NBC News, July 9-10, 2026.)",
    "NO DRAFT SIGNAL (July 10-11, 2026): No Selective Service activation, stop-loss, Guard/Reserve call-up, or conscription language accompanied the seizure threat or the regional exchange. The only standing item remains the pre-existing FY2026 NDAA administrative plan for automatic Selective Service registration of men 18-26 by December 2026 — not a draft activation; fact-checkers continue to rate reinstatement claims false. (CNBC; Newsweek, 2026.)"
