   "prediction_impact": "The Ground Invasion Tracker's core reading is unchanged and, if anything, sharpened: on Day 135 the seizure RHETORIC reached its wartime maximum (Trump: 'total control of their Oil and Gas Markets') while every EXECUTION indicator stayed at zero and the US posture turned back toward diplomacy. The predicted imminent US ground seizure of Kharg/Hormuz remains disconfirmed and inverted — Kharg was struck only from the air, oil terminals were spared, no landing or draft followed, and it is Iran, not the US, using force at the chokepoint."
