   "prediction_impact": "The Russia-Ukraine theatre stays untested against Predictive History's framing: the front remains a contested attritional stalemate (Kostiantynivka control disputed, ~12 sq mi net Russian gain in four weeks), diplomacy is stalled on Russia's maximalist Istanbul-Protocols terms, and there is no US ground-deployment surge — the US role stays materiel (Patriots, joint drone production), not manpower. The contested Kostiantynivka claim is tracked as an open question (kostiantynivka-control-contested-july-2026).",
