     "reading": "Russia's July 3 claim that it had 'liberated' Kostiantynivka reads two ways from the same record. Moscow's reading (Gerasimov to Putin, echoed by state media) treats the city as captured or effectively controlled — a milestone in the Spring-Summer 2026 offensive. Ukraine's reading (General Staff, Zelensky, 19th Corps commander Madyar) treats the Russian presence as small-group infiltration already being cleared at a lopsided loss ratio, with no consolidated control. ISW and DeepState side closer to the Ukrainian reading (infiltration, not control; ~12 sq mi net gain in four weeks), but granular street-level control is not verifiable from open sources in real time.",
