   "prediction_impact": "Secondary theatres remain untested/unfalsified against Predictive History's US-collapse and multi-front-overstretch framing: the US is prosecuting Maduro through civilian courts (a July 22 hearing) rather than facing a Venezuelan quagmire, North Korea's testing is contained to standoff weapons with no Korean-Peninsula kinetic breakout, and US-China friction stays in the tariff/legal register with no Taiwan military crisis — none of which involves a US ground commitment that would corroborate the imminent-great-power-war thesis."
