     "reading": "Whether Russia controls Kostiantynivka reads two opposite ways from the same July 3-4 record. Russia's reading (Gerasimov to Putin, MoD imagery): the city is 'liberated,' a major defensive hub of the Sloviansk-Kramatorsk line has fallen, and forces are pushing on toward Lyman. Ukraine's reading (Zelensky, General Staff): the claim is 'another Russian lie' — Ukrainian forces are still contesting the city, gains are small-group infiltration without consolidated control, and Zelensky's public challenge to Putin to 'meet me there' is meant to expose the claim as propaganda.",
