   "prediction_impact": "The July 3 pause-and-funeral keeps the imminent-ground-invasion / Hormuz-and-Kharg-seizure thesis disconfirmed-and-inverted: the US move was to halt talks for a week, not to stage a ground operation, and it is Iran that is asserting coercive Hormuz control (Tehran-designated routes, 'forceful response' threat), the inverse of a US seizure. Deal durability (iran-us-deal-reached-june-2026) stays the live risk, now suspended for the funeral week.",
