     "why_unresolvable": "It is not yet known whether the breach-retaliation cycle will repeat a third time, whether Iran will escalate to its threatened 'broader response,' or whether the 60-day roadmap survives the strain — all of which are forward-looking and undeterminable from open sources today.",
