   "source": "NBC News, 'U.S. launches strikes against Iran following attack on ship in Strait of Hormuz,' June 26, 2026; CBS News live updates, 'U.S. strikes Iran after Trump accuses Tehran of foolish violation of ceasefire,' June 26, 2026; Fox News Digital live blog, 'US strikes Iran after Strait of Hormuz cargo ship attack,' June 26, 2026; CNN, 'Iran strikes vessel, pausing UN efforts to evacuate ships from Hormuz,' June 25, 2026; CNBC, 'Rubio says Israel, Lebanon reach framework agreement,' June 26, 2026; Axios, 'Israel and Lebanon sign framework agreement,' June 26, 2026; Al Jazeera, 'Oil prices ease after spiking over halt to Strait of Hormuz evacuation plan' and 'US announces framework agreement between Israel and Lebanon,' June 26, 2026; Euronews, June 26, 2026; TradingEconomics, Brent crude, June 26, 2026."
