    "TROOP MOVEMENTS: No new ground deployment ordered. US strength in the CENTCOM area of responsibility is broadly unchanged (~50,000); the day's military action was an Iranian strike on a cargo vessel, not a US ground move.",
    "KHARG ISLAND: Seizure pathway remains superseded. The Iran question is being routed through diplomacy and a (now-contested) negotiated Hormuz reopening; no US naval assault posture against Kharg, no targeting reported. Iran's enforcement of its 'designated routes' is the inverse of a US seizure.",
    "AMPHIBIOUS / MARINES: USS Boxer ARG / 11th MEU stays disaggregated (amphibious mass removed). No new ARG/MEU surge, no forcible-entry concentration. No USS Tripoli/Bataan movement toward the theatre reported.",
