   "prediction_impact": "Day 120 keeps Predictive History's predicted US ground invasion / Kharg-and-Hormuz seizure disconfirmed-and-inverted: the re-escalation came from Iran firing on shipping (a maritime move), not from any US ground action. The blockade stays lifted, amphibious mass is disaggregated, and every US ground-execution indicator is at zero. The active frictions (Hormuz governance now enforced by fire, IAEA inspections) are maritime and diplomatic, not ground-force, signals.",
