     ],
     "why_unresolvable": "The dispositive facts — the final-deal text on who governs the Strait and whether Iran can levy any charge — do not yet exist; the MOU explicitly defers Strait governance to a 60-day negotiation, and both sides are asserting maximal positions for leverage.",
