     "why_unresolvable": "Whether Iran's Hormuz re-closure is transient leverage or the start of a collapse turns on events still unfolding — whether the Sunday June 21 technical talks reconvene and hold, whether the Lebanon ceasefire is restored, and whether the toll/fee and Israeli-withdrawal disputes are bridged — none of which can be adjudicated from open sources today; noted, not endorsed.",
