   "source": "CBS News live updates, 'U.S.-Iran deal signing sets stage for nuclear negotiations, but initial talks in Switzerland postponed,' June 19, 2026; CNBC, 'U.S.-Iran accord hits early snag after Swiss talks fail to proceed as planned,' June 19, 2026; NBC News, 'Israel and Hezbollah agree to a ceasefire after intensified fighting threatens U.S.-Iran talks,' June 19, 2026; CNN live updates, 'Israel and Hezbollah agree to renew ceasefire after conflict threatens to derail US-Iran talks,' June 19, 2026; SWI swissinfo.ch / Al Jazeera, 'What we know so far about the US-Iran ceremony in Switzerland,' June 18, 2026; TradingEconomics, Brent crude, June 19, 2026; Cubaheadlines, 'Unexpected Developments in U.S. Court Case Against Nicolás Maduro and Cilia Flores,' June 2026; Zero Carbon Analytics, 'Asian countries most at risk from oil and gas supply disruptions in Strait of Hormuz,' June 2026."
