     "evidentiary_status_short": "Same June 16 facts (Trump G7 touting + text 'within 24-48 hours' + Swiss Bürgenstock venue + fourth straight oil drop to ~$80 + Gharibabadi 'text finalized' vs. unreleased text, no in-person ceremony yet, Hormuz still closed/40-50-day mine-clearing, Araghchi-vs-US dispute on Israeli Lebanon withdrawal) support both 'firming settlement' and 'still-contested announcement' readings; not resolvable until the Friday ceremony and the actual Hormuz reopening either hold or slip.",
