     "evidentiary_status": "Both readings rest on the same June 15 record: the reported digital signing, Trump's 'I understand the answer is yes' on Khamenei, the SNSC confirmation, the authorized blockade lift, the three-month oil low, and the Friday ceremony are documented, and so are the not-yet-released text, the not-yet-physically-lifted blockade, the months-to-a-year mine-clearing timeline, and the live Lebanon strain (Beirut strike, Netanyahu non-binding, ministers' 'full force' threat). Open sources cannot yet establish whether the Friday ceremony occurs and the Hormuz reopening and ceasefire hold, or whether Lebanon reopens the kinetic track before the deal is fully executed.",
     "evidentiary_status_short": "Same June 15 facts (reported digital signing by Trump/Vance/Qalibaf + Trump says Khamenei approved + Iran SNSC confirmation + authorized blockade lift + three-month oil low + Friday Geneva ceremony vs. unreleased text, blockade not yet physically lifted, months-to-a-year mine-clearing, ongoing Israeli Lebanon strikes + Netanyahu non-binding) support both 'substantially-consummated settlement' and 'still-contested announcement' readings; not resolvable until the Friday ceremony and the actual Hormuz reopening either hold or slip.",
