   "theatre": null,
   "headline": "GROUND INVASION TRACKER — DAY 110 (JUNE 15-16): STATUS HOLDS no_ground_troops; THE DEAL FIRMS AND THE POSTURE STAYS DECISIVELY DE-ESCALATORY. THE WAR-ENDING MOU WAS REPORTEDLY ALREADY 'DIGITALLY' SIGNED JUNE 14 (DISCLOSED JUNE 15 BY VP VANCE), TRUMP SAYS KHAMENEI HAS APPROVED IT, AND IRAN'S SNSC CONFIRMED A FINALIZED 14-POINT DEAL THAT LIFTS THE NAVAL BLOCKADE WITHIN 30 DAYS, WITHDRAWS US FORCES FROM AROUND IRAN, AND REOPENS HORMUZ BY NEGOTIATION — THE STRUCTURAL INVERSE OF A GROUND BUILDUP. NO US GROUND TROOPS IN IRAN, NO KHARG GROUND ASSAULT, NO THIRD ARG / NEW MEU ORDER, NO BCT-SCALE GUARD ACTIVATION, NO DRAFT. THE BLOCKADE HAS NOT YET BEEN PHYSICALLY LIFTED (30-DAY WINDOW) AND HORMUZ MINE-CLEARING COULD TAKE MONTHS TO OVER A YEAR, BUT BOTH POINT TOWARD AN EVENTUAL DRAWDOWN, NOT REINFORCEMENT. THE ONLY US AIR-MOBILITY MOVEMENT REMAINS THE FOUR C-17s THAT CARRIED SIGNING-CEREMONY EQUIPMENT TO EUROPE FOR VP VANCE. CAVEAT: ISRAEL'S CONTINUED LEBANON STRIKES + NETANYAHU'S 'FREEDOM OF OPERATION' + MINISTERS' 'FULL FORCE' THREATS KEEP A KINETIC-RESUMPTION TRIPWIRE LIVE — BUT NONE IS A US GROUND MOVE.",
   "summary": "JUNE 15-16 (Day 110): The ground-invasion rung stayed at no_ground_troops and the day's developments pushed the posture further toward de-escalation. The June 14 war-ending MOU was reportedly already 'digitally' signed by Trump, Vance and Iran's Parliament Speaker Qalibaf (disclosed June 15 by VP Vance on ABC GMA), Trump said Supreme Leader Mojtaba Khamenei had approved it ('I understand the answer is yes'), and Iran's Supreme National Security Council confirmed a finalized 14-point deal that lifts the US naval blockade within 30 days, withdraws US forces from around Iran, and reopens the Strait of Hormuz by negotiation with Iranian mine-clearing — structurally the inverse of a ground buildup and a continued contradiction of Predictive History's predicted seizure of Hormuz / Kharg Island and occupation of Iranian oil infrastructure. No US ground troops entered Iran; no Kharg ground assault was ordered or executed; no third ARG and no new MEU were ordered; no BCT-scale Guard activation and no Selective Service/draft action occurred. The only US air-mobility movement remained the four C-17s that had carried signing-ceremony equipment to Europe for VP Vance — a diplomatic-logistics flight, not a combat deployment. Standing capability is unchanged but now points toward an eventual drawdown: ~50,000 troops in CENTCOM; three carrier strike groups plus the USS Tripoli ARG / 31st MEU that had been enforcing the now-to-be-lifted blockade; USS Boxer ARG / 11th MEU still under INDOPACOM; the 82nd Airborne forward HQ (Maj Gen Tegtmeier) remains a standing Kharg forcible-entry CONTINGENCY, not an execution order, and a fading one as the blockade-lift and force-withdrawal clauses move toward effect. Caveats keep a tripwire live rather than a buildup: the in-person ceremony is not until Friday June 19, the full text has not been released, the blockade lifts only 'within 30 days' with mine-clearing that could run a year, and Israel's continued Lebanon strikes plus Netanyahu's insistence on 'freedom of operation' and ministers' 'full force' threats could still trigger an Iranian resumption — but none of these is a US ground movement.",
   "details": [
    "DEAL FIRMS TOWARD CONSUMMATION — A DRAWDOWN VECTOR, NOT A BUILDUP (June 15, 2026): The MOU was reportedly already 'digitally' signed June 14 by Trump, Vance and Qalibaf (disclosed June 15); Trump says Khamenei approved it; Iran's SNSC confirmed a finalized 14-point deal lifting the naval blockade within 30 days, withdrawing US forces from around Iran, and reopening Hormuz by negotiation. These are the structural inverse of a ground buildup and a continued contradiction of the predicted Hormuz/Kharg seizure. (Al Jazeera; The Times of Israel; PBS NewsHour, June 15, 2026.)",
    "NO US GROUND MOVE; ONLY MOVEMENT IS SIGNING LOGISTICS (June 15-16, 2026): No US ground troops entered Iran, no Kharg ground assault was ordered or executed, no third ARG and no new MEU were ordered, no BCT-scale Guard activation and no Selective Service/draft action occurred. The only US air-mobility movement remained the four C-17s that carried signing-ceremony equipment to Europe for VP Vance's Geneva travel — a diplomatic-logistics flight, NOT a movement of ground combat power, assault shipping, armor, fuel/ammo prepositioning, or troops toward Iran.",
    "BLOCKADE NOT YET PHYSICALLY LIFTED — 30-DAY WINDOW, MINE-CLEARING UP TO A YEAR (June 15, 2026): Trump authorized the blockade's removal and Iran said it ends 'immediately and completely,' but the MOU specifies a complete lifting 'within 30 days,' the strait opens for mine removal only after Friday's signing, and analysts estimated full normalization could take 'months' to 'over a year.' The US thus retains its maritime instrument in the interim, but the codified direction is drawdown, not reinforcement. (Al Jazeera; NBC News, June 15, 2026.)",
    "LEBANON KEEPS A TRIPWIRE LIVE — NOT A US GROUND MOVE (June 14-15, 2026): Israel's June 14 Beirut/Dahieh strike killed at least three; on June 15 Netanyahu insisted he retains 'freedom of operation' against Hezbollah and Israeli ministers said Israel won't be bound by the Iran deal ('if Iran strikes, we'll hit it with full force'); Iran's Qalibaf warned the strikes threaten the deal; Trump warned Netanyahu not to 'blow it.' This is an Israeli operation in Lebanon plus a resumption-risk tripwire, NOT US ground troops in Iran. (The Times of Israel; CNBC, June 14-15, 2026.)"
   ],
   "prediction_impact": "Day 110 holds the ground-invasion rung at no_ground_troops for a 110th consecutive day and strengthens the de-escalatory reading: a reportedly digitally-signed, Khamenei-approved, SNSC-confirmed MOU that lifts the blockade and withdraws US forces is the codified inverse of the predicted seizure-and-occupation pathway. EXECUTION has not moved on the ground; the only live caveats (unreleased text, 30-day blockade-lift window, year-long mine-clearing, Lebanon tripwire) bear on whether the war ends cleanly, not on whether a US ground invasion is forming — none of them is a troop movement, Kharg assault, amphibious order, or draft action.",
   "source": "The Times of Israel, June 15, 2026 liveblog; Al Jazeera, 'US, Iran to sign a peace deal on Friday,' June 15, 2026; Al Jazeera, 'Stock markets soar, oil falls...,' June 15, 2026; NPR, June 15, 2026; NBC News, June 15, 2026; PBS NewsHour, June 15, 2026; CNBC, June 14, 2026."
