     "why_unresolvable": "The MOU is unsigned until the scheduled Friday June 19 Geneva ceremony; Supreme Leader Mojtaba Khamenei's ratification has not been publicly confirmed; and the live Lebanon track (Israeli strikes, Netanyahu's refusal to be bound) could still trigger an Iranian 'full-scale resumption' before signing — so open sources cannot yet determine whether the war has actually ended.",
     "open_question_ref": "iran-us-deal-reached-june-2026"
