     "evidentiary_status_short": "Same June 13 facts (Trump 'signed tomorrow' + Geneva/Vance signing logistics vs. unsigned text, US 'not 100%' confident, Iran 'no final decision,' unconfirmed Khamenei approval, 'no money' vs. $24B dispute) support both 'genuine signing' and 'another slipping/contested timeline' readings; not resolvable from open sources until a text is actually signed.",
