8 REDIRECTED + 5 DISABLED; HORMUZ TRAFFIC NEAR-ZERO — GROUND RUNG UNCHANGED: NO US GROUND TROOPS IN IRAN; NO NEW DEPLOYMENT ORDER, NO THIRD ARG, NO DRAFT; USS BOXER ARG STILL INDOPACOM; LINCOLN + BUSH CSGs + TRIPOLI ARG ARABIAN SEA; THE BEIRUT STRIKES / BEAUFORT / LEBANON TALKS ARE ISRAELI GROUND OPS + US DIPLOMACY, NOT US GROUND TROOPS IN IRAN (CONTESTED-UNRESOLVED — open-questions: nyt-intense-preparations-iran-resumption-may-2026; pezeshkian-resignation-irgc-takeover-may-2026)",
