   "headline": "Day 92 — CEASEFIRE DAY 52 / BLOCKADE DAY 47 / PROJECT FREEDOM PAUSED. MAY 28-29: NEGOTIATORS REACH TENTATIVE 60-DAY MOU — BUT THE DEAL IS DOUBLE-PENDING. AXIOS (MAY 28): US + IRANIAN NEGOTIATORS AGREE ON A 60-DAY MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING TO EXTEND THE CEASEFIRE + LAUNCH NUCLEAR TALKS; TRUMP HAS NOT SIGNED — 'THE PRESIDENT RELAYED TO THE MEDIATORS THAT HE WANTS A COUPLE OF DAYS TO THINK ABOUT IT'; IRAN HAS NOT CONFIRMED ACCEPTANCE; SUPREME LEADER MOJTABA KHAMENEI APPROVAL ALSO PENDING (ABC: 'NEGOTIATORS BELIEVE THEY HAVE A DEAL, BUT LEADERS HAVEN'T SIGNED OFF') — MOU TERMS (AXIOS): HORMUZ SHIPPING 'UNRESTRICTED' (NO TOLLS, NO HARASSMENT), IRAN CLEARS ALL MINES WITHIN 30 DAYS; US ISSUES SOME SANCTIONS WAIVERS TO LET IRAN SELL OIL FREELY; IRANIAN COMMITMENT NOT TO PURSUE A NUCLEAR WEAPON; FIRST 60-DAY-WINDOW ITEMS = HEU DISPOSITION + ENRICHMENT; US TO DISCUSS SANCTIONS RELIEF + FROZEN-FUND RELEASE — CONTRADICTION CARRIED OVER FROM MAY 27: WHITE HOUSE BRANDED AN IRANIAN-STATE-MEDIA MOU LEAK A 'COMPLETE FABRICATION' ('FACTS MATTER'); TRUMP SAID IRAN WILL NOT GET SANCTIONS RELIEF IN EXCHANGE FOR GIVING UP HEU; 'IRAN VERY MUCH INTENT, THEY WANT VERY MUCH TO MAKE A DEAL. SO FAR THEY HAVEN'T GOTTEN THERE... WE'RE NOT SATISFIED WITH IT, BUT WE WILL BE' — OIL PARTLY REBOUNDS ~2%: BRENT +2.1% TO ~$96.29/BBL, WTI +2.4% BACK ABOVE $90/BBL (THU MAY 28) — STILL A 'CLEAR RISK PREMIUM,' UNLIKELY TO REVERT TO PRE-WAR $60-70; WELL BELOW SUSTAINED $130+ A GROUND COMMITMENT WOULD REQUIRE; CNBC: 'OIL MARKETS ARE BETTING ON A SWIFT END TO THE IRAN WAR. INVESTORS MAY REGRET IT' — IRAN FM LINE: NUCLEAR ISSUES NOT PART OF CURRENT NEGOTIATIONS; FOCUS ON ENDING THE WAR ON ALL FRONTS (INCL LEBANON) + LIFTING SANCTIONS — RUSSIA-UKRAINE: 256 COMBAT CLASHES MAY 27 (~50 POKROVSK); ZELENSKY ANNOUNCES NEW LONG-RANGE OPS AFTER MEETING SYRSKYI + HNATOV; SOUFAN CENTER (MAY 28): RUSSIA'S SLOWING ADVANCES + UKRAINE'S RENEWED DRONE ADVANTAGE MAY MARK A TURNING POINT, BUT UKRAINE COULD STRUGGLE WITHOUT US/EUROPEAN SUPPORT; SECOND DIRECT ROUND ~JUNE 2 — DPRK: KIM OVERSEES 5 HWASONG-11RA BM LAUNCHES WITH CLUSTER-BOMB / FRAGMENTATION-MINE WARHEADS (2ND MAY TEST); BACKS CHINA'S 'MULTIPOLAR WORLD' + ONE-CHINA PRINCIPLE IN MEETING WITH WANG YI — USS BOXER ARG STILL INDOPACOM; USS GERALD R. FORD HOME; LINCOLN + BUSH CSGs + TRIPOLI ARG ARABIAN SEA — HORMUZ TRAFFIC NEAR-ZERO — NO NEW GROUND-DEPLOYMENT ORDER, NO THIRD ARG, NO DRAFT; THE TENTATIVE MOU ROUTES HORMUZ THROUGH A NEGOTIATED REOPENING (NO TOLLS + IRANIAN MINE-CLEARING), NOT A GROUND SEIZURE; THE NAMED DEAL-FAILURE ALTERNATIVE STAYS AIR/STRIKE-PACKAGE (CONTESTED-UNRESOLVED — open-questions: nyt-intense-preparations-iran-resumption-may-2026)",
