     "why_unresolvable": "Whether a deal is truly 'largely negotiated' and will be signed and hold — versus a unilateral US characterization advanced ahead of a still-open impasse — cannot be determined from open sources until a final text is published or the Sunday decision resolves toward signature or re-strike.",
