     "reading": "The Apr 30 Cooper/Caine briefing on strike options + Dark Eagle hypersonic deployment request marks the start of US escalation past the May 1 War Powers deadline, including potential ground operations to seize Hormuz / Kharg Island and special forces uranium-recovery raid",
