     "why_unresolvable": "The same Apr 30 events are consistent with both 'cabinet briefing as escalation runway' and 'cabinet briefing as menu of bargaining leverage.' Will be resolved by Trump's response to Cooper/Caine briefing in May 1-7 window AND Iran's revised proposal arrival Friday May 1.",
