   "prediction_impact": "ELEVATED RELEVANCE. Apr 30 cycle marks the FIRST MATERIAL UPWARD SHIFT in ground-invasion probability since the war began — moving from NEAR-ZERO to LOW-BUT-NON-ZERO. Predictions of US ground operations against Iran, Kharg Island seizure, special forces raids on Iran's nuclear program, Hormuz seizure operations, and War Powers congressional confrontation should be re-scored against this dataset. The Cooper/Caine briefing crosses options-at-the-briefing-table threshold but stops short of execution; the next 1-2 weeks will be dispositive."
